      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REBORN MYSTIQUE (2) turned in a moderate run last time when sixth at this track over 515m behind Done Dealing (30.27) in a Grade 4/5. Comes through a solid form race last start. Has ability and can bounce back. NOVEL (1) scored two back then drifted back and missed the frame latest finishing a 6 length 5th at this track (23.13). Has a strong record out of this box with three wins and two minor placings from six starts. Key runner who gets her chance to atone. FASCINATE GLORY (7) struggled to get involved last start after settling off pace at this track, but prior to that won by 2.5 lengths at this track (23.01) beating Jungle Tiger in a Mix 2/3 on August 7. Has the ability to give this a shake. SUNNYBROOK (3) was a surprise last-start placegetter with solid claims again.",
